\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S4}{Stress test results: maximum cell count on a single DGX H100 node (8$\times $H100, 2 TB RAM) using the memory-optimised pipeline. Timings exclude DE testing, which was benchmarked separately (Table S6). Memory in GiB. Rows are a selection of the 16 sizes that completed (1.7M to 11.9M cells); the result files of all of them are in the repository. Above 3.4M cells the input contains replicated cells (see text).}}{14}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
