\newlabel{tab:S5}{{S5}{15}{Stress test}{table.5}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S5}{Indicative memory budget at 11.9M cells, the largest completed run (GiB). Baseline components are read from the 11.9M-cell memory trace and sum to the 535 GiB recorded there; all rows refer to 11.9M cells. The transient contributions are estimated from the operations in the pipeline code; they are not measured, because the instrumentation samples only between steps and only the parent process (Methods). The budget does not account for the full working set at any moment, and is presented to indicate which operations dominate.}}{15}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
