\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S3}{\ignorespaces Total pipeline wall time on three Visium platforms: CPU reference (one DGX H100 node, 100 CPUs) and GPU (one RTX 4090), mean of five repeats, each in a fresh process; error bars: SD. Labels give the speedup (ratio of means). At Visium HD 8~\textmu {}m the bars include co-occurrence, whose GPU result with rapids-singlecell 0.14.1 was incorrect (see text); the dashed lines mark the totals without it (6.9$\times $). Visium HD 2~\textmu {}m was randomly subsampled to 400,000 bins (389,492 after QC) to fit in the 24 GiB of the RTX 4090.}}{17}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:S3}{{S3}{17}{Total pipeline wall time on three Visium platforms: CPU reference (one DGX H100 node, 100 CPUs) and GPU (one RTX 4090), mean of five repeats, each in a fresh process; error bars: SD. Labels give the speedup (ratio of means). At Visium HD 8~\textmu {}m the bars include co-occurrence, whose GPU result with rapids-singlecell 0.14.1 was incorrect (see text); the dashed lines mark the totals without it (6.9$\times $). Visium HD 2~\textmu {}m was randomly subsampled to 400,000 bins (389,492 after QC) to fit in the 24 GiB of the RTX 4090}{figure.3}{}}
