\newlabel{tab:S8}{{S8}{19}{Spatial concordance}{table.8}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S8}{Spatial concordance between the CPU reference (DGX node) and GPU pipelines, CPU repeat k against GPU repeat k (k = 1-5): a single value when it is the same in the five pairs, otherwise the range. SVG Jaccard reports the overlap of spatially variable genes ranked by Moran's I. Co-occurrence and neighbourhood enrichment were skipped on the HD 2~\textmu {}m subsample (more than 500 groups); at Visium HD 8~\textmu {}m the GPU co-occurrence is the incorrect result of rapids-singlecell 0.14.1 (see text). N clusters: groups returned by each pipeline's own Leiden run in each repeat. With the workstation CPU as reference, CPU Leiden returned 16, 7 and 2,559 groups and the ARI was 0.856, 0.972-0.975 and 0.084.}}{19}{table.8}\protected@file@percent }
